  "comment": {
   "comments": [
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "60785ded115da6006f540529",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/6d51465aa828084aeddbf6d03c81fdc4?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FAW-3.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Andrew Woods",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=60785ded115da6006f540529",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "The issue is related to:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "content": [
           {
            "content": [
             {
              "text": "ModeShape introduces some namespaces that do not terminate in either a '/' or '#' delimiter",
              "type": "text"
             },
             {
              "type": "hardBreak"
             },
             {
              "text": "Such as:",
              "type": "text"
             },
             {
              "type": "hardBreak"
             },
             {
              "text": "xs: ",
              "type": "text"
             },
             {
              "marks": [
               {
                "attrs": {
                 "href": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema"
                },
                "type": "link"
               }
              ],
              "text": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema",
              "type": "text"
             },
             {
              "type": "hardBreak"
             },
             {
              "text": "xsi: ",
              "type": "text"
             },
             {
              "marks": [
               {
                "attrs": {
                 "href": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
                },
                "type": "link"
               }
              ],
              "text": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance",
              "type": "text"
             }
            ],
            "type": "paragraph"
           }
          ],
          "type": "listItem"
         }
        ],
        "type": "bulletList"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "content": [
           {
            "content": [
             {
              "text": "Fedora includes the set of namespaces when updating/adding a property:",
              "type": "text"
             },
             {
              "type": "hardBreak"
             },
             {
              "marks": [
               {
                "attrs": {
                 "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-kernel-modeshape/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/kernel/modeshape/FedoraResourceImpl.java#L845"
                },
                "type": "link"
               }
              ],
              "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-kernel-modeshape/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/kernel/modeshape/FedoraResourceImpl.java#L845",
              "type": "text"
             }
            ],
            "type": "paragraph"
           }
          ],
          "type": "listItem"
         }
        ],
        "type": "bulletList"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "content": [
           {
            "content": [
             {
              "text": "The resultant concatenated full-qualified terms are incorrect.",
              "type": "text"
             }
            ],
            "type": "paragraph"
           }
          ],
          "type": "listItem"
         }
        ],
        "type": "bulletList"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "One possibility is to \"fix\" the namespaces by adding the '#' delimiter prior to having Jena execute the update request.",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-kernel-modeshape/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/kernel/modeshape/FedoraResourceImpl.java#L845"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://github.com/fcrepo4/fcrepo4/blob/master/fcrepo-kernel-modeshape/src/main/java/org/fcrepo/kernel/modeshape/FedoraResourceImpl.java#L845",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "From a user perspective, an immediate option is to use the fully qualified term(s):",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "\"2019-05-22\"^^<",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "text": ">",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "..instead of the prefixed term(s):",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "\"2019-05-22\"^^xs:dateTime ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
